{"id": "EUVD-2026-105166", "enisaUuid": "a81c3195-b888-35f3-ac6f-e8c727678d9c", "description": "Fat Free CRM before 0.26.0 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability that allows authenticated users to modify or delete other users' comments because CommentsController#update and #destroy use an unscoped Comment.find without authorization checks. Attackers can send PUT or DELETE requests to /comments/:id with enumerable sequential IDs to edit or delete comments on contacts, accounts, leads, and opportunities owned by others.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T15:40:28", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T15:40:28", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/fatfreecrm/fat_free_crm/issues/1650", "https://github.com/fatfreecrm/fat_free_crm/commit/3c3199328dd10414b1f039ab8e4a82fe0f3baf87", "https://github.com/fatfreecrm/fat_free_crm/releases/tag/v0.26.0", "https://github.com/fatfreecrm/fat_free_crm/blob/v0.25.0/app/controllers/comments_controller.rb", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/fat-free-crm-before-0.26.0-idor-via-commentscontroller-update-and-destroy"], "aliases": ["GHSA-gh75-88g6-gr96", "CVE-2026-113600"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d0a9364d-1a46-3199-bab2-01c5ee9021ec", "product": {"name": "fat_free_crm", "vendor": {"name": "fatfreecrm"}}, "product_version": "0 <0.26.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "182c6122-7112-375b-b6be-33954781fe31", "vendor": {"name": "fatfreecrm"}}], "isExploited": false}